      "_intent": "Class 1A and Class 1B rates [draft]",
      "_title": {
        "text": "Class 1A and Class 1B rates"
      },
      "_summary": {
        "text": "They must also pay Class 1A on some other lump sum payments, for example redundancy payments. HMRC has detailed guidance on all Class 1A and Class 1B rates."
      },
      "_lines": [
        {
          "_text": {
            "text": "Employers pay Class 1A and 1B National Insurance on expenses and benefits they give to their employees. The rate from 6 April 2026 to 5 April 2027 on expenses and benefits is 15%."
          }
